.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Shadowman is feared across the galaxy for the ruin
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]he leaves behind, though his rampage may be less
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]random than it looks. He was once Har Grimoire,
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]an acclaimed scientist devoted to his daughter Elle,
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]until a lab accident killed her and nearly killed him.
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Thought dead, he rebuilt himself inside armor that
.L 107.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]both keeps him alive and makes him more than
.L 117.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]human, and set out to find OVA -- an outlawed
.L 127.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]project to rebuild a person from a single DNA
.L 137.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]sample, which he's sure still exists somewhere. He'll
.L 147.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]let nothing stop him.
.CP
.SH
\&Shadowman: Attacks
.PP
\&Laser Sword: A glowing beam of light that instills fear into those who would dare face him.
.PP
\&Psycho-Kinetic Crush: Shadowman uses his amplified mental powers to toss around the opponent.
.SH
\&Shadowman: Character Hooks
.PP
\&He's an obvious enemy for Karis, but anyone protecting the common good can end up opposing him. Curiously, Karis looks a great deal like Elle.
